                "loc": "EXO.30.22+EXO.30.23+EXO.30.24+EXO.30.25+EXO.30.26+EXO.30.27+EXO.30.28+EXO.30.29+EXO.30.30+EXO.30.31+EXO.30.32+EXO.30.33+EXO.30.34+EXO.30.35+EXO.30.36+EXO.30.37+EXO.30.38"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nia 30.22-38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otiyo moo maleŋ me wir bene, ki odok eceta ma ŋwece kur ma giliyo maber, ma girubo kit macalo larub gin ma ŋwe kur timo-ni.",
